{"id": "ST_DeathScreen|DS_SubText", "source_en": "You've been recalled to the Order for your failures.", "category": "ui_menu", "speaker": null, "ar": "تم استدعاؤك إلى الجماعة بسبب إخفاقاتك.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 40}}
{"id": "ST_DialogBoxStrings|AbandonRunHeader", "source_en": "Abandon Run?", "category": "ui_menu", "speaker": null, "ar": "هجر الجولة؟", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 40}}
{"id": "ST_DialogBoxStrings|AbandonRunBody", "source_en": "Are you sure you want to end the Run and leave the current session?\n\nYour run progress and souls will be lost.\n\nYou will be returned to the Sanctus Clypeus.", "category": "ui_menu", "speaker": null, "ar": "هل أنت متأكد من إنهاء الجولة ومغادرة الجلسة الحالية؟\n\nسيتم فقدان تقدمك في الجولة والأرواح.\n\nستعود إلى سانكتوس كليبيوس.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 40}}
{"id": "ST_DialogBoxStrings|QuitSessionGenericBody", "source_en": "Are you sure you want to leave the current session?\n\nYour Run progress, souls, and equipment will be saved and you will be returned to the main menu.", "category": "ui_menu", "speaker": null, "ar": "هل أنت متأكد من مغادرة الجلسة الحالية؟\n\nسيتم حفظ تقدمك في الجولة والأرواح والمعدات، وستعود إلى القائمة الرئيسية.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 40}}
{"id": "ST_DialogBoxStrings|QuitSessionBody", "source_en": "Are you sure you want to leave the current session?\n\nYour run progress, souls, and equipment will be saved. The current mission progress will be lost. \n\nYou will be returned to the main menu.", "category": "ui_menu", "speaker": null, "ar": "هل أنت متأكد من رغبتك في مغادرة الجلسة الحالية؟\n\nسيتم حفظ تقدمك في الجولة، والأرواح، والمعدات. سيتم فقدان تقدم المهمة الحالية. \n\nستعود إلى القائمة الرئيسية.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 40}}
{"id": "ST_DialogBoxStrings|AbandonRunGenericBody", "source_en": "Are you sure you want to return to the hub?", "category": "ui_menu", "speaker": null, "ar": "هل أنت متأكد من رغبتك في العودة إلى المركز؟", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 40}}
{"id": "ST_DialogBoxStrings|QuitGameGenericBody", "source_en": "Are you sure?\n\nYour Run progress, souls, and character will be saved and the game will exit.", "category": "ui_menu", "speaker": null, "ar": "هل أنت متأكد؟\n\nسيتم حفظ تقدمك في الجولة، والأرواح، والشخصية، وسيتم الخروج من اللعبة.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 40}}
{"id": "ST_DialogBoxStrings|QuitGameBody", "source_en": "Are you sure? \n\nYour Run progress, souls, and equipment will be saved. The current mission progress will be lost. The game will exit. ", "category": "ui_menu", "speaker": null, "ar": "هل أنت متأكد؟ \n\nسيتم حفظ تقدمك في الجولة، والأرواح، والمعدات. سيتم فقدان تقدم المهمة الحالية. سيتم الخروج من اللعبة.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 40}}
