{"id": "ST_DialogBoxStrings|QuitSessionHeader", "source_en": "Leave Session?", "category": "ui_menu", "speaker": null, "ar": "مغادرة الجلسة؟", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 40}}
{"id": "ST_DialogBoxStrings|ChunkInstallBody", "source_en": "To continue the game requires additional content to install.\nOnce the content has installed you will be able to progress.", "category": "ui_menu", "speaker": null, "ar": "يتطلب الاستمرار في اللعبة تثبيت محتوى إضافي.\nبمجرد تثبيت المحتوى، ستتمكن من التقدم.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 40}}
{"id": "ST_DialogText|Dialg_DeleteSave", "source_en": "Are you sure you want to delete this save?\n\nYou will lose all progress and items.", "category": "ui_menu", "speaker": null, "ar": "هل أنت متأكد من رغبتك في حذف هذا الحفظ؟\n\nستفقد كل التقدم والأدوات.", "needs_review": false, "note": "", "provenance": {"stage": "primary", "model": "gemma4-12b-awq", "prompt": "cm-pilot-v1", "intent_localization_required": true, "batch": 40}}
